# apps/web (Next.js marketing site)
#
# Local: copy to .env.local (Next loads .env.local automatically).
# Production: set these on your host (Vercel, Railway, etc.).

# Express API base URL — required for server-side `/uploads/*` and `/api/*` proxies (set to your deployed API URL in production).
API_URL="http://localhost:3001"

# Optional: public API URL for `<img>` `/uploads/*` (inlined at build time). Match your deployed API `https://…` in production.
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL="http://localhost:3001"

# Optional: client-side same-origin `/api/...` is preferred for JSON from this app.
#
# Troubleshooting: if `next dev` returns 404 for `/_next/static/...` or MODULE_NOT_FOUND for a numbered chunk,
# stop the server and run `pnpm dev:clean` (or `rm -rf .next && pnpm dev`) in this directory.
